<title>USA: MBIA qualifies nine muni issues for insurance.</title>
<headline>MBIA qualifies nine muni issues for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp said Tuesday it qualified for bond insurance the following nine municipal bond issues scheduled for competitive sale today:</p>
<p>--Paola, Kan., $3.7 million of GO bonds.</p>
<p>--Paolo, Kan., $2.1 million of GO bonds.</p>
<p>--Sumpter Township, Mich., $1.2 million of GO bonds.</p>
<p>--Laurel, Miss., $4 million general obligation bonds.</p>
<p>--Lyndhurst Township, N.J., $706,000 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Lyndhurst Township, N.J., $3.5 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Lyndhurst Township, N.J., $7.1 million GOs.</p>
<p>--South Brunswick Township, N.J., $3.9 million GOs.</p>
<p>--South Brunswick Township, N.J., $3.8 million GOs.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
